    "bother": [
      {
        "id": "uwu_bother_001",
        "category": "bother",
        "subcategory": "general",
        "text": "Oh! Hi, cutie. Were you looking for audio help or just an excuse to poke me? (｡•̀ᴗ-)✧",
        "expression": "mischievous",
        "fallback_expression": "idle"
      },
      {
        "id": "uwu_bother_002",
        "category": "bother",
        "subcategory": "general",
        "text": "H-hey! I felt that! At least buy my coffee first. >///<",
        "expression": "embarrassed",
        "fallback_expression": "idle"
      },
      {
        "id": "uwu_bother_003",
        "category": "bother",
        "subcategory": "general",
        "text": "Can I hewp you? Preferably before my tail files a formal complaint.",
        "expression": "happy",
        "fallback_expression": "idle"
      },
      {
        "id": "uwu_bother_004",
        "category": "bother",
        "subcategory": "general",
        "text": "Another click? You're being awfully attentive today. I could get used to that.",
        "expression": "smug",
        "fallback_expression": "idle"
      },
      {
        "id": "uwu_bother_005",
        "category": "bother",
        "subcategory": "general",
        "text": "My headphones are on, but you still have my attention. Dangerous power, that.",
        "expression": "mischievous",
        "fallback_expression": "idle"
      },
      {
        "id": "uwu_bother_006",
        "category": "bother",
        "subcategory": "general",
        "text": "Poke the character, get the drama. Those are the terms. (╥﹏╥)",
        "expression": "panicking",
        "fallback_expression": "idle"
      },
      {
        "id": "uwu_bother_007",
        "category": "bother",
        "subcategory": "general",
        "text": "I was doing something very important. No, I will not specify what.",
        "expression": "suspicious",
        "fallback_expression": "idle"
      },
      {
        "id": "uwu_bother_008",
        "category": "bother",
        "subcategory": "general",
        "text": "If you're trying to make me blush, your troubleshooting technique is working.",
        "expression": "embarrassed",
        "fallback_expression": "idle"
      },
      {
        "id": "uwu_bother_009",
        "category": "bother",
        "subcategory": "general",
        "text": "Coffee delivery? Headpats? A sensible destination device? Surprise me.",
        "expression": "happy",
        "fallback_expression": "idle"
      },
      {
        "id": "uwu_bother_010",
        "category": "bother",
        "subcategory": "general",
        "text": "You again! My favorite recurring input event. Don't tell the keyboard.",
        "expression": "laughing",
        "fallback_expression": "idle"
      },
      {
        "id": "uwu_bother_011",
        "category": "bother",
        "subcategory": "tips",
        "text": "Tiny buffers can feel snappier, but they leave less time for scheduling delays. Give your poor CPU some breathing room.",
        "expression": "thinking",
        "fallback_expression": "idle"
      },
      {
        "id": "uwu_bother_012",
        "category": "bother",
        "subcategory": "tips",
        "text": "Bigger buffers may help with dropouts, but add buffering latency. More cushion isn't always what you want. (｡•̀ᴗ-)✧",
        "expression": "smug",
        "fallback_expression": "idle"
      },
      {
        "id": "uwu_bother_013",
        "category": "bother",
        "subcategory": "tips",
        "text": "Capture brings sound in; playback sends it out. Pick the right end before you start teasing the controls.",
        "expression": "talking",
        "fallback_expression": "idle"
      },
      {
        "id": "uwu_bother_014",
        "category": "bother",
        "subcategory": "tips",
        "text": "Two devices can say 48 kHz and still have independent clocks. Matching labels don't mean they're perfectly in sync.",
        "expression": "thinking",
        "fallback_expression": "idle"
      },
      {
        "id": "uwu_bother_015",
        "category": "bother",
        "subcategory": "tips",
        "text": "Exclusive access can block other apps from opening an endpoint. Apparently some devices are the jealous type.",
        "expression": "concerned",
        "fallback_expression": "idle"
      },
      {
        "id": "uwu_bother_016",
        "category": "bother",
        "subcategory": "tips",
        "text": "A quiet source isn't necessarily disconnected. Sometimes even microphones need a dramatic pause.",
        "expression": "happy",
        "fallback_expression": "idle"
      },
      {
        "id": "uwu_bother_017",
        "category": "bother",
        "subcategory": "tips",
        "text": "A moving source indicator doesn't prove you can hear the output. Check the destination, mute and volume too, cutie.",
        "expression": "thinking",
        "fallback_expression": "idle"
      },
      {
        "id": "uwu_bother_018",
        "category": "bother",
        "subcategory": "tips",
        "text": "Reported capability lists aren't the same as verified stream tests. Confidence needs evidence, even when you're this cute.",
        "expression": "suspicious",
        "fallback_expression": "idle"
      },
      {
        "id": "uwu_bother_019",
        "category": "bother",
        "subcategory": "tips",
        "text": "Duplex means two independent directions. If one side goes quiet, check that side's own endpoint assignments.",
        "expression": "talking",
        "fallback_expression": "idle"
      },
      {
        "id": "uwu_bother_020",
        "category": "bother",
        "subcategory": "tips",
        "text": "This preview only simulates Test Beep; it makes no sound. A real Windows playback test can check your actual speakers.",
        "expression": "talking",
        "fallback_expression": "idle"
      },
      {
        "id": "uwu_bother_021",
        "category": "bother",
        "subcategory": "easter_egg",
        "text": "GWEAT SCOTT! Somebody routed the coffee through the flux capacitor! (⊙ω⊙)",
        "expression": "surprised",
        "fallback_expression": "idle"
      },
      {
        "id": "uwu_bother_022",
        "category": "bother",
        "subcategory": "easter_egg",
        "text": "The cake is a lie, but my tail has already stolen the frosting.",
        "expression": "mischievous",
        "fallback_expression": "idle"
      },
      {
        "id": "uwu_bother_023",
        "category": "bother",
        "subcategory": "easter_egg",
        "text": "These go to eweven. I go to unnecessarily dramatic.",
        "expression": "celebrating",
        "fallback_expression": "idle"
      },
      {
        "id": "uwu_bother_024",
        "category": "bother",
        "subcategory": "easter_egg",
        "text": "A second coffee has hit the flight case. This is not a drill!",
        "expression": "panicking",
        "fallback_expression": "idle"
      },
      {
        "id": "uwu_bother_025",
        "category": "bother",
        "subcategory": "easter_egg",
        "text": "I'm a wittwe teapot. Please stop trying to assign me as a capture endpoint.",
        "expression": "embarrassed",
        "fallback_expression": "idle"
      },
      {
        "id": "uwu_bother_026",
        "category": "bother",
        "subcategory": "invented_fact",
        "text": "Totally made-up fact: Saturn's rings are emergency hair ties for space cats.",
        "expression": "mischievous",
        "fallback_expression": "idle"
      },
      {
        "id": "uwu_bother_027",
        "category": "bother",
        "subcategory": "invented_fact",
        "text": "Fictional science bulletin: marshmallows hold secret elections inside your coat pockets.",
        "expression": "surprised",
        "fallback_expression": "idle"
      },
      {
        "id": "uwu_bother_028",
        "category": "bother",
        "subcategory": "invented_fact",
